  },
  {
    "text": "To kick off after signing. No lengthy onboarding, just straight to work.",
    "tag": "div",
    "color": "var(--token-4d926bee-328f-497f-a3cd-ce0b138f5bc3, rgb(184, 184, 184))"
  },
  {
    "text": "turnaround on most requests. Complex projects broken into manageable sprints.",
    "tag": "div",
    "color": "var(--token-4d926bee-328f-497f-a3cd-ce0b138f5bc3, rgb(184, 184, 184))"
  },
  {
    "text": "Every engagement starts with understanding. We dive deep into your business, your challenges, and where you want to go. No assumptions, just questions that matter.",
    "tag": "div",
    "color": "var(--token-4d926bee-328f-497f-a3cd-ce0b138f5bc3, rgb(184, 184, 184))"
  },
  {
    "text": "Before any pixels are pushed, we align on direction. Whether it's a brand identity or product redesign, we make sure we're solving the right problem.",
    "tag": "div",
    "color": "var(--token-4d926bee-328f-497f-a3cd-ce0b138f5bc3, rgb(184, 184, 184))"
  },
  {
    "text": "We work in focused cycles with regular check-ins. You'll see progress weekly, not monthly. No big reveals, no surprises—just steady momentum.",
    "tag": "div",
    "color": "var(--token-4d926bee-328f-497f-a3cd-ce0b138f5bc3, rgb(184, 184, 184))"
  },
  {
    "text": "Your feedback shapes the work. We iterate based on what's working and what isn't, refining until everyone's genuinely excited about the results.",
    "tag": "div",
    "color": "var(--token-4d926bee-328f-497f-a3cd-ce0b138f5bc3, rgb(184, 184, 184))"
  },
  {
    "text": "We stick around for implementation and measure what matters. Every project teaches us something that makes the next one better.",
    "tag": "div",
    "color": "var(--token-4d926bee-328f-497f-a3cd-ce0b138f5bc3, rgb(184, 184, 184))"
  },
  {
    "text": "Pricing",
    "tag": "div",
    "color": "var(--token-4d926bee-328f-497f-a3cd-ce0b138f5bc3, rgb(184, 184, 184))"
  },
  {
